{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/88450728834eee91eb33bb8b769e7d9a.avif?t=1772491622\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Are You!? is a sci-fi psychological horror game, where you'll face the unknown in order to save your family.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>DISCLAIMER</strong>\u00a0\u26a0\ufe0f</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an episodic game. The first episode will be released in Q1 2026. Purchasing the first episode will grant you access to Episodes 2 and 3 when they're released.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a deep, engaging experience with an immersive narrative, so pay attention to your surroundings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI was used for art, sound design or development in this game. Every aspect crafted by human hands and creativity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/e7ef420909baf2cbbbde92b6c7df1a3e.avif?t=1772491622\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research Collaboration Notice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who Are You!? is developed with the support and insights of renowned Argentine ufologists Silvia and Andrea P\u00e9rez Simondini.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silvia is a pioneering UFO researcher, founder of the UFO Museum in Victoria, Entre R\u00edos, and director of the research group Visi\u00f3n OVNI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Andrea is Director of CEFORA and South America Continental Director for ICER, recognized internationally for her work on UAPs and anomalous phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their real-world investigations and knowledge have helped shape the game's narrative and authenticity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/ec6fda8f3361ed2f1b61436be01811ca.avif?t=1772491622\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep narrative based on true ufology stories and investigations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional and psychological interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/42216c9425eaab406fcc84fe2635a42c.poster.avif?t=1772491622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/42216c9425eaab406fcc84fe2635a42c.webm?t=1772491622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/42216c9425eaab406fcc84fe2635a42c.mp4?t=1772491622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/deb42aae8b118838ea21956d787d0e7f.avif?t=1772491622\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The story follows Ray Roswell, who lost his wife 20 years ago. Now, his only daughter has gone missing. In his search for her, Ray not only embarks on a physical journey but also confronts the emotional and psychological trauma of his past, reliving the pain he has tried to forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/ea644a0e4e382154dc6093e2306bc30f.poster.avif?t=1772491622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/ea644a0e4e382154dc6093e2306bc30f.webm?t=1772491622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/ea644a0e4e382154dc6093e2306bc30f.mp4?t=1772491622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2646450?t=1772491622","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/05b8982eb0dbade1397451879282fc7c4d1ac12f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772491622","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/c4f556cfd5752fba19b4044e40da9a82640c6ba8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772491622","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/c4f556cfd5752fba19b4044e40da9a82640c6ba8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772491622","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Corpses, Blood, General Mature Content"},"demos":[{"appid":2648320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/88450728834eee91eb33bb8b769e7d9a.avif?t=1772491622\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Are You!? is a sci-fi psychological horror game, where you'll face the unknown in order to save your family.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>DISCLAIMER</strong>\u00a0\u26a0\ufe0f</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an episodic game. The first episode will be released in Q1 2026. Purchasing the first episode will grant you access to Episodes 2 and 3 when they're released.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a deep, engaging experience with an immersive narrative, so pay attention to your surroundings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI was used for art, sound design or development in this game. Every aspect crafted by human hands and creativity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/e7ef420909baf2cbbbde92b6c7df1a3e.avif?t=1772491622\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research Collaboration Notice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who Are You!? is developed with the support and insights of renowned Argentine ufologists Silvia and Andrea P\u00e9rez Simondini.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silvia is a pioneering UFO researcher, founder of the UFO Museum in Victoria, Entre R\u00edos, and director of the research group Visi\u00f3n OVNI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Andrea is Director of CEFORA and South America Continental Director for ICER, recognized internationally for her work on UAPs and anomalous phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their real-world investigations and knowledge have helped shape the game's narrative and authenticity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/ec6fda8f3361ed2f1b61436be01811ca.avif?t=1772491622\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep narrative based on true ufology stories and investigations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional and psychological interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/42216c9425eaab406fcc84fe2635a42c.poster.avif?t=1772491622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/42216c9425eaab406fcc84fe2635a42c.webm?t=1772491622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/42216c9425eaab406fcc84fe2635a42c.mp4?t=1772491622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/deb42aae8b118838ea21956d787d0e7f.avif?t=1772491622\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The story follows Ray Roswell, who lost his wife 20 years ago. Now, his only daughter has gone missing. In his search for her, Ray not only embarks on a physical journey but also confronts the emotional and psychological trauma of his past, reliving the pain he has tried to forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/ea644a0e4e382154dc6093e2306bc30f.poster.avif?t=1772491622\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/ea644a0e4e382154dc6093e2306bc30f.webm?t=1772491622\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/extras/ea644a0e4e382154dc6093e2306bc30f.mp4?t=1772491622\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Haunting Humans Studio"],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646450/c2daff4b648a44abcf8fd98c3c20531bf4dd027f/header.jpg?t=1772491622","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2646450/1976879848/4efacccd194eef07c29c959dd863b47f566d2dee/1772160778/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772162455","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2646450/1976879848/4efacccd194eef07c29c959dd863b47f566d2dee/1772160778/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772162455","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2646450/1976879848/4efacccd194eef07c29c959dd863b47f566d2dee/1772160778/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772162455","id":257209611,"name":"Who Are You!? Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257209611/fb6bbde6a73deb6824db5cd895b95f5349b480a4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772162455"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2646450/1826454894/bc9464655a22172f8d28bed50e448e16cf7829c0/1772161551/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772162456","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steam